Client Control keeps network clients, their addresses, groups, access, and
speed limits in one OPNsense page. Before changing traffic, it shows the exact
aliases, firewall rules, and Traffic Shaper objects that will be created,
updated, or removed.

The plugin starts disabled. Saving a form does not reload firewall rules.
Existing aliases can be imported without editing or deleting the source
aliases. Objects changed outside Client Control are reported instead of being
silently overwritten.
